  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bukusu Maize Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Maize.Beneficiaries: 8200 smallholder farmers of whom 3715.Project funds will be used to construct a storage facility, procure a truck for transportation of produce, acquire value addition equipment in form of a maize mill and feed mill. Other project funds will provide working capital for procurement of maize grain and farm inputs.</narrative>
  </description>
